<title>LATVIA: VALMIERA H1 PROFIT AROUND 400,000 LATS - BOURSE.</title>
<headline>VALMIERA H1 PROFIT AROUND 400,000 LATS - BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange said on Tuesday that Valmiera Glassfibre expected its first-half profit to be around 400,000 lats on sales of 5.26 million lats.</p>
<p>The stock exchange said that the company held a meeting on July 3 and 4, when its board discussed a modernisation plan.</p>
<p>It also said that the company's full financial figures would be available around July 25.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
